(Sheldon:)There is nothing to say.
Except I'm the bigger man.

4
00:00:10,927 --> 00:00:12,727
(Sheldon:)I'm not kidding. Say it.

5
00:00:15,232 --> 00:00:16,252
(Raj:)Just say it.

6
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,870
(Howard:)You're the bigger man, Sheldon.

7
00:00:19,069 --> 00:00:20,729
(Sheldon:)Oh, stop.

8
00:00:21,838 --> 00:00:25,038
(Sheldon:)And I believe this is yours.

9
00:00:25,575 --> 00:00:29,405
(Sheldon:)FYI, if you wear that into a bank,
they will tackle you to the ground.

10
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:36,240
(Howard:)I'd like to propose a toast.

11
00:00:36,453 --> 00:00:38,423
(Howard:)To burying the hatchet.

12
00:00:39,056 --> 00:00:40,856
(Howard:)To burying the hatchet.

13
00:00:43,093 --> 00:00:45,123
(Sheldon:)You know,
I'm kind of glad this happened.

14
00:00:45,362 --> 00:00:49,092
Me too. In a weird way,
I kind of feel like it brought us closer.

15
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:02,020
(Penny(with two black eyes and a plaster across her nose):)Yeah, everybody's happy. Great.

